<title>POLAND: Warta sets dividend at PLN 1.0.</title>
<headline>Warta sets dividend at PLN 1.0.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Annually</p>
<p>				    1996			1995</p>
<p> Amount (PLN)		   1.0			 1.5</p>
<p> Pay				 na</p>
<p> Record			    na</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the Polish insurance company is Towarzystwo Ubezpieczen i Asekuracji Warta SA. Shareholders decide on the dividend on May 14. The firm said the one- zloty-per-share dividend represented 3,461,518 zlotys.</p>
<p>Warta made a net profit of 18.1 million zlotys last year.</p>
